Problem 4
✏️ Steps / Flow
Create an empty stack.
Push all elements into the stack.
Create an empty result list.
Pop elements one by one from the stack.
Add each popped element to the result list.
Return the result list.

START

Input nums

Create empty stack
Create empty list result

FOR each element in nums
    Push element into stack
END FOR

WHILE stack is not empty
    Pop element from stack
    Add popped element to result
END WHILE

Return result

STOP
